config BCM2835_VC_THERMAL
	bool "Raspberry Pi BCM2835 VideoCore SoC temperature sensor"
	default y
	depends on DT_HAS_RASPBERRYPI_BCM2835_VC_THERMAL_ENABLED
	depends on BCM2835_FIRMWARE
	help
	  Enable the Raspberry Pi BCM2835/2710 SoC temperature sensor.
	  The SoC die temperature is read through the VideoCore firmware
	  GET_TEMPERATURE property tag (the source behind
	  `vcgencmd measure_temp`) and exposed as SENSOR_CHAN_DIE_TEMP.
